msgstr "Antal dage, logs gemmes"

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:150
msgid "Are you sure you want to clear all logs? This action cannot be undone."
msgstr "Er du sikker på, at du vil rydde alle logs? Det kan ikke fortrydes."

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:151
msgid "An error occurred. Please try again."
msgstr "Der opstod en fejl. Prøv igen."

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:152
#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:748
msgid "Search (email / action / role)"
msgstr "Søg (e-mail / handling / rolle)"

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:153
#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:746
msgid "Search (email / tier / status)"
msgstr "Søg (e-mail / niveau / status)"

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:188
msgid "Verification Token is required."
msgstr "Verifikationstoken skal udfyldes."

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:193
msgid "Role Expiry Days is required and must be a number when expiry is enabled."
msgstr "Når udløb er slået til, skal du angive rollens gyldighed i dage."

#. translators: %s is the role name that was rejected.
#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:213
#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:229
#, php-format
msgid "Security: Role \"%s\" cannot be assigned via webhook for security reasons."
msgstr "Sikkerhed: Rollen \"%s\" kan af sikkerhedshensyn ikke tildeles via webhook."

#. translators: %s is the role name that was rejected.
#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:241
#, php-format
msgid "Security: Role \"%s\" cannot be used as default role for security reasons."
msgstr "Sikkerhed: Rollen \"%s\" kan af sikkerhedshensyn ikke bruges som standardrolle."

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:290
msgid "A token is saved. Leave this blank to keep it, or paste a new one to replace it."
msgstr "Der er gemt et token. Lad feltet stå tomt for at beholde det, eller indsæt et nyt for at erstatte det."

#. translators: %s is the first eight characters of the saved token's SHA-256 hash.
#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:293
#, php-format
msgid "Saved token fingerprint: %s"
msgstr "Fingeraftryk af det gemte token: %s"

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:297
msgid "No token set yet. Webhooks are rejected until one is saved."
msgstr "Der er endnu ikke gemt et token. Webhook-forespørgsler afvises, indtil du gemmer et."

#. translators: %s is a link to the Ko-fi Webhooks Management page.
#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:307
#, php-format
msgid "This token is used to verify incoming webhook requests from Ko-fi. Paste the verification token from this page: %s and open the Advanced box. Only a hash of it is stored, so it cannot be shown again; to change it, paste the new one."
msgstr "Dette token bruges til at bekræfte, at webhook-forespørgsler kommer fra Ko-fi. Åbn %s, find sektionen Advanced, og kopiér verifikationstokenet. Der gemmes kun en hashværdi af tokenet, så det kan ikke vises igen. Indsæt et nyt token for at erstatte det."

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:308
msgid "Ko-fi Webhooks Management"
msgstr "Ko-fi Webhooks Management"

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:322
msgid "Webhook URL:"
msgstr "Webhook-URL:"

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:325
msgid "Copy to Clipboard"
msgstr "Kopiér til udklipsholder"

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:327
msgid "Use this URL to configure your Ko-fi webhook."
msgstr "Brug denne URL, når du opsætter din webhook i Ko-fi."

#. translators: %s is a human-readable time span, e.g. "3 days".
#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:372
#, php-format
msgid "Scheduled tasks are not running: role expiry and log cleanup are %s overdue. Make sure WP-Cron runs, or that a system cron calls wp-cron.php."
msgstr "Planlagte opgaver kører ikke: udløb af roller og oprydning i logs er %s forsinket. Sørg for, at WP-Cron kører, eller at et system-cronjob kalder wp-cron.php."

#. translators: 1: email address, 2: comma-separated role names, or "no role".
#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:424
#, php-format
msgid "Members for Ko-fi: an account was created by Ko-fi's \"Send test\" button (%1$s, role: %2$s). It is not a real supporter; earlier versions treated tests as payments. You can safely delete it."
msgstr "Members for Ko-fi: Ko-fi's \"Send test\"-knap har oprettet en konto (%1$s, rolle: %2$s). Det er ikke en rigtig supporter; tidligere versioner behandlede test som betalinger. Du kan roligt slette den."

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:426
msgid "none"
msgstr "ingen"

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:430
msgid "Review the account"
msgstr "Se kontoen"

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:440
msgid "Members for Ko-fi: two different verification tokens are stored, and webhooks are checked against the hashed one. Re-enter your Ko-fi verification token in the settings to resolve this."
msgstr "Members for Ko-fi: der er gemt to forskellige verifikationstokens, og webhooks tjekkes mod det hashede. Indtast dit Ko-fi-verifikationstoken igen i indstillingerne for at løse det."

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:465
msgid "Open settings"
msgstr "Åbn indstillinger"

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:481
msgid "When enabled, users must be active subscribers to receive a role."
msgstr "Når det er slået til, skal brugere have et aktivt abonnement for at få en rolle."

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:498
msgid "Ko-fi Tier"
msgstr "Ko-fi-niveau"

#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:498
#: src/Admin/AdminSettings.php:1097
msgid "Role"
